@startuml
title Planned evidence retrieval flow
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #2F3A4A
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFF
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF7D6
  DiamondBorderColor #8A6D00
}

start
:Prepare patient-specific case context;
note right
Includes current notes, relevant history,
specialist findings and missing-input status.
end note
:Create retrieval query from case context;
:Search selected external clinical sources;
:Rank and filter candidate passages;

if (Relevant cited evidence found?) then (yes)
  :Attach source references and supporting passages;
  :Provide evidence to Clinical Reasoning Agent;
  :Display citations beside clinical draft;
else (no)
  :Mark evidence as insufficient or unavailable;
  :Prevent unsupported evidence claims;
endif

:Safety and Critic Agent checks draft support;
:Physician reviews draft, evidence and critic findings;
stop
@enduml
